PoolOptions poolOptions = new PoolOptions().setMaxSize(5);

// Create the client pool (use .using(vertx) if you want to pass your Vertx instance)
SqlClient client = PgBuilder
  .client()
  .with(poolOptions)
  .connectingTo(connectOptions)
  .build();
```

The previous `PgPool.client()` style is **deprecated/removed** in Vert.x 5. You now use the builder pattern: `PgBuilder.client().with(...).connectingTo(...).build()`. If you want to explicitly use a Vert.x instance, add `.using(vertx)` in the chain.

