rometer/backends/BackendRegistries.java`【3:1†source】【3:3†source】.\n\nSummary:\n- `BackendRegistries` is a utility for working with and registering Micrometer meter registries in Vert.x.\n- Methods likely include ways to register, retrieve, and manage these registries.\n- Used when you want Vert.x to share or manage custom/non-default Micrometer registry backends.\n\nTo see all method details for version 5.0.0, the GitHub source or generated JavaDoc is your best resource.",
